  "`interactivity_tok_s_user = 1000 / tpot_p50_ms`: the per-user output speed once decoding has started, excluding TTFT (InferenceMAX interactivity).": "`interactivity_tok_s_user = 1000 / tpot_p50_ms`，表示开始解码后的单用户输出速度（tok/s/user），不含 TTFT，采用 InferenceMAX interactivity 口径。",
  "`output_tok_s` and `total_tok_s` divide all generated (and input) tokens by the point's wall time from the first request sent to the last request finished.": "输出吞吐（`output_tok_s`）和总吞吐（`total_tok_s`）均以该点位从首个请求发出到最后一个请求结束的实际时长为分母。前者的分子为生成 token 总数，后者为输入与生成 token 数之和。",
  "`request_rate_req_s` is the open-loop arrival rate; for those points `concurrency` is the in-flight cap and is empty when unlimited.": "`request_rate_req_s` 是开环负载的请求到达率。这些点位的 `concurrency` 表示在途请求数上限，空值表示不限。",
  "`sessions` is planned sessions and `requests` is actually attempted logical requests; skipped rounds are separate and retries would be additional attempts. Run done means execution ended, not that every session completed.": "`sessions` 是计划会话数，`requests` 是实际发起的逻辑请求数。跳过的轮次单列，每次重试另计一次尝试。运行状态为 done 表示执行已结束，仍可能有未完成的会话。",
